{"games":[{"id":72992062125248,"name":"Hunters","desc":"⚠️IMPORTANT! THIS GAME IS STILL IN HEAVY DEVELOPMENT, MORE CONTENT SOON⚠️\n\nDive into the world of Hunters where you are chosen by the system, as the main character you must prepare to fight dangerous enemies & powerful bosses.\n\n🗡️ Fight hordes of enemies & conquer dungeons to level up!\n🔄 Click \"ROLL\" to roll various types of loot that will help you progress!\n👫 Team up with friends to defeat powerful bosses!\n\nLevel up offline — return later to harvest your exp gains!\n\n📢 Join our community for live updates and announcements!\n🍀 Join our group for extra luck boosts!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/communities/35687503/MS-Hunters#!/about\n\nDo you have what it takes to become the king of humans? 👑 \n\n🎮CONTROLS:\nM1 - Basic Attack\nM2 - Feint\nW+W - RUN\nF - Block (Time for Parry)\nQ - DASH","path":"/game/72992062125248-hunters","slug":"72992062125248-hunters","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/73f9ac7420b69112499cd234ae3b79d193dcaa9e2513f0d37d2eaeac7e25da5a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-be33e2662a7122af39cb270fc2911d37/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":59255734,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-17T11:31:09.237Z","creator":{"name":"MS: Hunters","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":25,"freeCount":24,"keyCount":11,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":16541340872,"name":"Clark County","desc":"The County of Clark is the largest county in the State of Mayflower, home to the busiest and most populous city in the Union of Columbia; the City of Lander.\n\nThe area that is now the County of Clark was settled by colonists hailing from Pax Britannia in December of 1771 as a part of the original 14 colonies as Pax Landeria. Proceeding the end of the revolution against Pax Britannia in July of 1776 and the creation of the Union of Columbia and the State of Mayflower, the County of Clark was created as one of the four original counties of the State of Mayflower.\n\nThe current county seat for the County of Clark is the Town of Mersea. Alongside the county seat, the County of Clark is home to the state seat for the State of Mayflower; the City of Lander.\n\nThis experience is constantly developing and is prone to changes, including shutdowns and the wipe of player data.\n\nThe in-game time period is in the early 2000s.","path":"/game/16541340872-clark-county","slug":"16541340872-clark-county","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6c51779dc32f5daab51af80306dbedd6e85986b7094e676ce2e78118ff6631dd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-83c1c28152000990d8b8cd663edfb613/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":3177168,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-30T19:58:24.662Z","creator":{"name":"State οf Mayflowеr","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15327256235,"name":"🪏 Dig To Build","desc":"Welcome to Dig To Build! 💪 🎉 UPDATES EVERY SATURDAY!\n\n⛏️ Click to mine blocks!\n🏡 Place blocks to build a house!\n🌎 Build different houses & earn wins!\n🐾 Collect pets to help you collect blocks!\n\nPREMIUM PLAYERS ENJOY +20% EARNING SPEED & +10% EGG LUCK\nDO YOU LAG? USE A FREE VIP SERVER ❤️\n\nJoin Our Group for Exclusive Codes & Bug Reporting!","path":"/game/15327256235-dig-to-build","slug":"15327256235-dig-to-build","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ddb559c7142790d828f52406cf0fa197e4a08873657da40e85206f6c1b788d45.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f6720aca4e8bbd247fe2a080f4879061/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":32228648,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-08-09T05:25:54.258Z","creator":{"name":"axel fmw #1 x caleb","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":16984716324,"name":"Sour Patch Kids Mischief Tycoon","desc":"","path":"/game/16984716324-sour-patch-kids-mischief-tycoon","slug":"16984716324-sour-patch-kids-mischief-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4294ca9e5a4ad80862058d538ac79c92aec49